  "description": "High-performance streaming hash library for .NET 10. All 70 algorithms implemented natively in pure C# with zero heavy dependencies. Features MurmurHash3, CityHash, SpookyHash, SipHash, FarmHash, HighwayHash, MetroHash, KangarooTwelve, wyhash, xxHash, plus complete cryptographic suite (SHA-3, BLAKE, Keccak, RIPEMD, Whirlpool, Tiger, GOST, Streebog, Skein, SM3, Grøstl, JH). Unified HashFacade API with batch streaming for parallel multi-algorithm processing. SIMD-optimized: Grøstl (AES-NI), JH (SSSE3), HighwayHash (AVX2), CRC-32C (SSE4.2), BLAKE2b (AVX2). 1853+ tests, 20 algorithms faster than BouncyCastle.",
